-- One-column gas/water model for SWATINIT with horizontal subdivision
-- (EQUIL item 9 = -2).  The gas/water contact is 1 m below the centre of
-- cell 4.  SWATINIT is 0.3 in cells 1-3 and 1.0 (= Swmax) in cells 4-7, and
-- the capillary pressure is small, but non-zero, at Sw = 1.
--
